E02A DC08             (    forth6809.asm):03021                   LDD  CODEHERE   ; BUG FIX: was storing CODEHERE's value as-is,
E02C C30002           (    forth6809.asm):03022                   ADDD #2         ; but at this point CODEHERE points at THIS
E02F 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03023                   PSHU D          ; very cell, about to be written by the next
E031 BDDEE1           (    forth6809.asm):03024                   JSR  CODECOMMA  ; CODECOMMA - self-referential, not pointing
