E795 ED66             (    forth6809.asm):04333                  STD   6,S       ; S by 2 before this write, landing 2 bytes
E797 39               (    forth6809.asm):04334                  RTS             ; past the LEAVE flag DOSETUP actually pushed.
                      (    forth6809.asm):04335                                   ; Fixed by deferring PULS X to after the
                      (    forth6809.asm):04336                                   ; write - but that left a PULS X/PSHS X pair
                      (    forth6809.asm):04337                                   ; that had become a genuine no-op (nothing
                      (    forth6809.asm):04338                                   ; between them touches S or X, and this
