                      (    forth6809.asm):05479                                  ; negated even when genuinely negative - found
                      (    forth6809.asm):05480                                  ; via MAME: TSTMSTAR's two returned values
                      (    forth6809.asm):05481                                  ; came back wrong, which turned out to be
                      (    forth6809.asm):05482                                  ; this, not a push-order swap in the test
                      (    forth6809.asm):05483                                  ; itself. FMSLASHMOD/SMSLASHREM already do
                      (    forth6809.asm):05484                                  ; this correctly (explicit TST PRODHI between
                      (    forth6809.asm):05485                                  ; their own CLR calls and the branch) - MSTAR
