                      (    forth6809.asm):07540                                      ; FM/MOD: DIVCOMMON restores the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07541                                      ; remainder's sign from DNSIGN (the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07542                                      ; dividend's own original sign) after
                      (    forth6809.asm):07543                                      ; dividing absolute values - exactly
                      (    forth6809.asm):07544                                      ; SM/REM's own logic, confirmed identical
                      (    forth6809.asm):07545                                      ; by direct comparison. FM/MOD, by
                      (    forth6809.asm):07546                                      ; contrast, has an explicit flooring
                      (    forth6809.asm):07547                                      ; adjustment step (correcting the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07548                                      ; quotient and remainder when the
